      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>This spell causes targets to see an illusory star pattern, naturally occurring space phenomena, or another general skyscape you choose the details of during casting. The spell’s effects grant a +3 circumstance bonus to Bluff checks or related skill checks to convince the targets of something related to the false skyscape, such as their location on a planet according to the stars.</p>"
